":" 可以提供如图所示方向的稳定电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I = 2.8\\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不计其他电阻，小圆盘和飞轮质量忽略不计。\n（1）开关接 1，静止释放重物，重物带动圆盘转动。求：\n①电容器上极板所带电荷的电性；\n②当重物以 1m/s 的速度下落时，辐条切割磁场所产生的电动势大小；\n③飞轮稳定转动时，飞轮的角速度大小和电容器所带电荷量；\n（2）开关接 2，恒流源给飞轮供电，求飞轮稳定转动时恒流源的输出功率。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bfda1bb7d78b719b9038d3998332e76501c2fdaec5d6ddb927b42ae72d42bafb.png","width":634,"height":456,"width_mm":74.343,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2610-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）\n(1) ①上极板带正电 ..... (1分)\n②"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega=\\frac{v}{r_{2}}=10rad/s"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{1}{2}B\\omega r_{1}^{2}=1.25V"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (2分)\n③"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{1}{2}B\\omega r_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"P=\\frac{E^{2}}{R+\\frac{R}{2}}=mg\\omega r_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega=48rad/s"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"U=\\frac{1}{3}E=2V"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)\nQ=CU=0.2C ..... (1分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bcda416c765042cb291b9ac868075058c9f42ad513463f299b8569cefac1aabd.png","width":352,"height":144,"width_mm":44.5},{"type":"text","value":"(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{机}} = E_{\\text{反}} I_2 = \\frac{1}{2} B \\omega r_1^2 I_2 = mg \\omega r_2"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) 得"},{"type":"math","value":"I_2 = 0.8A"},{"type":"math","value":"I_1 = 2A"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"U = I_1 \\frac{R}{2} = 5V"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{出}} = UI = 14W"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7b8e361166673aa5cce8150efa6dc30f96f441d59a7dec821021e26426def8d1.png","width":416,"height":240,"width_mm":52.7}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2610-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2610","source_question_id":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2610-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"220f3090940cc76291b589da9ff1d46daec13c3af47630884cf4be3f70103696","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）如图所示为利用离子刻蚀芯片的简化示意图。离子源发出质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的正离子（不计重力），沿水平中轴线 "},{"type":"math","value":"OO_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 经速度选择器后，进入边长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的正方形偏转区，该区可加电场也可加磁场。已知速度选择器与偏转区的匀强电场均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向相反；匀强磁场均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向垂直纸面向外。仅加电场时离子出射偏转角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" 很小，且 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\alpha = \\frac{1}{25}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。正离子偏转后进入共振腔，腔内加有水平向右的匀强磁场，大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。不考虑电磁场突变的影响，离子进入共振腔后不碰壁。共振腔的坐标系如图所示， "},{"type":"math","value":"z"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴方向长度可调节。共振腔尽头有待刻蚀芯片，芯片足够大。已知角度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 很小时， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta \\approx \\tan \\theta \\approx \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos \\theta \\approx 1 - \\frac{\\theta^2}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。求：\n(1) 离子的电荷量;\n（2）若偏转区仅加磁场，离子出射时偏离 "},{"type":"math","value":"OO_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴线的距离；\n（3）若偏转区仅加电场，出偏转区后的离子从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 点进入共振腔，z 轴方向长度调节为 "},{"type":"math","value":"125\\pi L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求离子打在芯片上的坐标；\n（4）若偏转区仅加电场，电场强度随时间周期性变化，范围为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\frac{1}{2}E_{1},2E_{1}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" 。自动调节共振腔位置，使得所有正离子经过偏转场后均能从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 点进入共振腔，z轴方向长度固定为 "},{"type":"math","value":"175\\pi L"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知离子穿过偏转区的时间远小于偏转电场的变化周期，请通过分析，在下面坐标系上（从左往右看），画出芯片的刻蚀图案，并计算刻蚀长度。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/47efd9e8309d21e653ddb55a9c6686bd81e120ffdbc85a50e608a3a604573aaf.png","width":900,"height":367,"width_mm":105.634,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2610-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 18 题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e682af33b3029eb53aee818320e042972150bb6f051646a429d12a0c59954c9c.png","width":337,"height":299,"width_mm":39.482,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2610-q18-row2"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）（1）离子沿水平中轴线"},{"type":"math","value":"OO_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"经过速度选择器，离子做匀速直线运动，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB_{1}=qE_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"偏转区仅加电场时，水平方向有L=vt 竖直方向有"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}=\\frac{qE_{1}}{m}t"},{"type":"text","value":"根据速度分解有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan\\alpha=\\frac{v_{y}}{v}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\frac{mE_{1}}{25LB_{1}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n（2）离子在磁场中做匀速圆周运动，由洛伦兹力提供向心力，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB_{1}=m\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"结合上述解得R=25L ……（1分）\n设偏转角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，偏转角等于圆心角，根据几何关系有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin\\theta=\\frac{L}{R}\\approx\\tan\\theta\\approx\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"离子出射时偏离"},{"type":"math","value":"OO_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"轴线的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"d=R(1-\\cos\\theta)=R\\left(1-1+\\frac{\\theta^{2}}{2}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"d=\\frac{L}{50}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n（3）正离子在共振腔里面做螺旋运动，z 方向速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{z}=\\frac{E_{1}}{B_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，打到芯片时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{125\\pi L}{v_{z}}=\\frac{125\\pi LB_{1}}{E_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n……（1分）\n螺旋运动周期为"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac{2\\pi m}{qB_{2}} = \\frac{100\\pi LB_{1}}{E_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n……（1分）\n所以 t = 1.25T，螺旋运动转 1.25 圈，旋转半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\frac{mv_{y}}{qB_{2}}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y} = \\frac{v_{z}}{25} = \\frac{E_{1}}{25B_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，带入得到 r = 2L，\n……（1分）\n所以打在芯片上的坐标为（2L，-2L，"},{"type":"math","value":"125\\pi L"},{"type":"text","value":"）\n……（1分）\n（4）正离子进入共振腔后，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"不同，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{z}"},{"type":"text","value":"相同，T 不变，回旋半径不同、螺距相同。"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"范围"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\frac{E_{1}}{50B_{1}}, \\frac{2E_{1}}{25B_{1}}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"，螺旋运动旋转半径范围为"},{"type":"math","value":"(L, 4L)"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（1分）\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"z"},{"type":"text","value":"轴方向长度为"},{"type":"math","value":"175\\pi L"},{"type":"text","value":"，得到时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{175\\pi L}{v_z} = 1.75T"},{"type":"text","value":"，即转1.75圈。 （1分）根据图形相似性，得到芯片的刻蚀图案如下，\n长度为"},{"type":"math","value":"3\\sqrt{2} L"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d55e96471586126b4f0f8cc06f1e965708017529233bbaf77632d265e9dde2eb.png","width":178,"height":174,"width_mm":22.5},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}}]}
